  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In our days, everywhere we go, we see everyone on the phones. So i think, instead of having the quick menu, it would be cool having it in a style of a phone that everyone could see, where you could send messages for your friends or even call them like real life, even if they are in the same world or a different one. In case you dont want to be disturbed, the phone could have an option of having the sound of your phone on mute for the messages and for the calls, have an option that dont allow people to call you.\nIf you dont want the phone thing as a menu, at least, i think, the feature of sending messages and doing calls could be really cool. \nThank you.",
